#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.slope.rst:2
msgid "slope"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:1
msgid ""
"Returns the slope of simple linear regression of ``y`` on ``x`` over the "
"given dimension ``dim``."
msgstr "指定された次元 ``dim`` において、``y`` を ``x`` に回帰させた単回帰の傾きを返します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:4
msgid ""
"This function computes the ordinary least squares slope coefficient "
":math:`\\beta` of the regression :math:`y = \\alpha + \\beta x`:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、回帰式 :math:`y = \\alpha + \\beta x` の最小二乗法による傾き係数 :math:`\\beta` "
"を計算します:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:7
msgid ""
"\\beta = \\frac{\\sum_i (x_i - \\bar{x})(y_i - \\bar{y})}\n"
"{\\sum_i (x_i - \\bar{x})^2}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\beta = \\frac{\\sum_i (x_i - \\bar{x})(y_i - \\bar{y})}\n"
"{\\sum_i (x_i - \\bar{x})^2}\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:11
msgid ""
"In quantitative finance, this is used, for example, to estimate the beta "
"of an asset's returns against market returns."
msgstr "クオンツファイナンスでは、例えば市場リターンに対する資産リターンのベータを推定するために用いられます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:14
msgid ""
"NOTE: This is based on calculation of slope beta at: "
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simple_linear_regression"
msgstr "注意：この計算は単純線形回帰の傾きβの計算に基づいています：https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simple_linear_regression"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.slope.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:18
msgid "The input tensor of explanatory (independent) values."
msgstr "説明変数（独立変数）の値を含む入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:21
msgid ""
"The input tensor of response (dependent) values.  Its shape must be "
"broadcastable to the shape of ``x``."
msgstr "目的変数（従属変数）の値を含む入力テンソル。その形状は ``x`` の形状にブロードキャスト可能でなければなりません。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:25
msgid ""
"The dimension or dimensions to reduce. Default is ``()`` (reduce over all"
" dimensions)."
msgstr "縮約する次元（複数可）。デフォルトは ``()``\\ （すべての次元にわたって縮約）です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:29
msgid ""
"Whether the output tensor has ``dim`` retained or not. Default is "
"``False``."
msgstr "出力テンソルが ``dim`` を保持するかどうか。デフォルトは ``False`` です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.slope.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:33
msgid ""
"The slope coefficient of the linear regression over the specified "
"dimensions."
msgstr "指定された次元にわたる線形回帰の傾き係数。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.slope.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:38
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:40
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([2.0, 4.0, 6.0, 8.0])\n"
">>> QF.slope(x, y)\n"
"tensor(2.)"
msgstr ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([2.0, 4.0, 6.0, 8.0])\n"
">>> QF.slope(x, y)\n"
"tensor(2.)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:45
msgid ""
">>> y = torch.tensor([1.0, 3.0, 2.0, 5.0])\n"
">>> QF.slope(x, y)\n"
"tensor(1.1000)"
msgstr ""
">>> y = torch.tensor([1.0, 3.0, 2.0, 5.0])\n"
">>> QF.slope(x, y)\n"
"tensor(1.1000)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:49
msgid ""
"If all :attr:`x` values are identical (zero variance), the slope is "
"mathematically undefined and the result is NaN."
msgstr "すべての :attr:`x` の値が同一（分散ゼロ）の場合、傾きは数学的に未定義であり、結果はNaNになります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:53
msgid ":func:`nanslope`: NaN-aware slope function."
msgstr ":func:`nanslope`: NaNを考慮した傾き関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:54
msgid ":func:`correl`: Pearson correlation function."
msgstr ":func:`correl`: ピアソン相関関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:55
msgid ":func:`covar`: Covariance function."
msgstr ":func:`covar`: 共分散関数。"

